 "name_en": "Supply Chain Automation with SAP Business Network (5I2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Supply Chain Automation with SAP Business Network (5I2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A subcontract purchase requisition is either generated via the Material Requirements Planning (MRP) process or manually by a requester. The purchase requisition is converted into a subcontract purchase order. The purchase order is subject to approval based on predefined parameters before being issued to the subcontractor. The outbound delivery is created, and the goods are picked and shipped to the subcontractor. With the supply of the finished material, the goods receipt is created. The consumption of the sent components is recorded upon the receipt of the value-added finished material. The invoicing process is then triggered.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Send approved purchase orders electronically to your suppliers via SAP Business Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive digital order confirmations automatically from your suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process digital advanced shipping notification sent by your suppliers electronically in SAP Business Network into inbound deliveries in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send goods receipt automatically to suppliers in SAP Business Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive invoices from suppliers electronically in SAP Business Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update suppliers digitally in SAP Business Network on invoice status updates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Start payment runs upon receiving supplier invoices in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> Accounts Payable</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send payment advice automatically to suppliers via SAP Business Network</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Streamline subcontracting processes efficiently and cost effectively</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Speed up procurement processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase productivity of procurement and accounts payable staff</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce inquiries about payments from suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase productivity in accounts payables department</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure highly automated processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual effort greatly and transactional costs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor the process progress in real time</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Business Network 的供应链自动化 (5I2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">转包采购申请可以通过物料需求计划 (MRP) 流程生成，也可以由申请人手动生成。采购申请将转换为转包采购订单。采购订单在签发给转包商之前，应根据预定义参数进行审批。创建出库交货，拣配货物并装运至转包商。随着成品物料的供应，创建收货。收到增值成品物料后，将记录已发送组件的消耗。然后触发开发票流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Business Network 以电子方式向供应商发送批准的采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动接收来自供应商的数字订单确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network 中以电子方式将供应商的数字提前装运通知处理为 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 中的入库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network 中自动向供应商发送收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network 中以电子方式接收来自供应商的发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据发票状态更新在 SAP Business Network 中以数字方式更新供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 应付账款中收到供应商发票后开始付款运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Business Network 自动向供应商发送付款通知</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofd98481a1aee47108cbc316a4a42ca1e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">经济高效地简化转包流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加快采购流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高采购和应付账款人员的工作效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少关于供应商付款的询问</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高应付账款部门的工作效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保高度自动化的流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">大幅减少手动工作量和交易成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实时监控流程进度</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
